          <Pad Id="OzMvtiP0mKvVoJ1znWpy4o" Bounds="60,970,520,110" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="A map: VL.Mapsui draws NTS geometry, this package does not know maps exist.&#xD;&#xA;Reprojection: an SRID is a label, it never moves a coordinate.&#xD;&#xA;Disjoint, Count, ForEach: build them from nodes you already have.&#xD;&#xA;The rest of NetTopologySuite: reachable through vvvv's raw .NET nodes.&#xD;&#xA;Units follow the coordinates. Mixing SRIDs never throws - it quietly answers wrong.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation>
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
